%% ADR-0050 proposal. No pull request exists. shell/board/ is a predicted folder, and its rules are pure.
%% The shell loads the index once. The board gets resolved rows as props and never calls the data layer.
sequenceDiagram
    participant Reader
    participant Shell as App.tsx and useShellState
    participant Data as src/data/
    participant Board as shell/board/ ProgramBoard
    participant Query as shell/board/ rule modules
    participant Clip as navigator.clipboard

    Reader->>Shell: Opens the board address /board
    Shell->>Data: loadIndex() once at start
    Data-->>Shell: entities and joins
    Shell->>Data: rows for the board
    Data-->>Shell: rows with stage, status, lifecycle, and pr
    Shell->>Board: passes the rows as props
    Board->>Query: boardModel(rows, address)
    Note over Query: program, orphans, q, sort, hide, and cards come from the address
    Query-->>Board: BoardModel with columns, shown, total, and orphans
    Note over Query: the columns are the five lanes of workDeck.ts, and Superseded starts hidden
    Board-->>Reader: each program in the column of its stage

    Reader->>Board: Clicks a program card
    Board->>Shell: changes the address to /board?program=kanban-board
    Note over Shell,Board: the change pushes one history entry, and the rows stay loaded
    Shell->>Board: passes the same rows as props
    Board->>Query: boardModel(rows, address)
    Query-->>Board: BoardModel with Planned, In progress, and Done
    Board-->>Reader: epic cards and the epics to slices switch

    Reader->>Board: Clicks the copy icon
    Board->>Query: promptFor(epic card)
    Query-->>Board: /implement:start kanban-board board-page
    Board->>Clip: writeText(prompt)
    alt the clipboard accepts the write
        Clip-->>Board: the promise resolves
        Board-->>Reader: notice Prompt copied
    else the clipboard refuses the write
        Clip-->>Board: the promise rejects
        Board-->>Reader: notice Copy failed, with the prompt text
    end
